-marrow,bone marrow & blood anatomy,Red marrow; Yellow marrow; Trabecular (spongy) bone,Bone marrow & blood anatomy,The hidden factory: red marrow makes two million blood cells per second; yellow marrow stores energy; both sit behind bone you see every day.
