-femalepelvis,female pelvis & perineum anatomy,Urinary bladder; Female urethra; Vagina,Female pelvis & perineum anatomy,"The female pelvic floor in sagittal section: bladder and urethra, vagina and anteverted uterus, rectum behind — plus the ligaments and pouches that position them."
