-gynadnexa,ovary & uterine tube anatomy,Ovarian cortex; Ovarian medulla; Primordial follicles,Ovary and fallopian tube anatomy,"From follicular cortex to ampulla: the ovary, fimbriae, tubal mucosal folds and the hidden routes of fertilization."
