-maleprostate,"prostate, ducts & penis anatomy",Bladder neck / internal sphincter; Prostatic transition zone; Prostatic peripheral zone,"Prostate anatomy: zones, ducts and urethra","Prostatic zones and the urinary–ejaculatory crossing: urethra, verumontanum, ducts, seminal vesicles and erectile bodies."
